{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation in a multimodal multiprofile setup using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder with weighted fusion. The validation accuracy of 0.7250 suggests transformer aggregation may improve performance compared to avgpool, though the lower validation F1 (0.6847) and potential interactions with fusion strategy or encoders remain uncertain."
}

